2 CONT >>1.        [https://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000185361954882 ARNAUD de Gavre] (-1 May 1418).  Goethals records his parentage without citing any source which confirms the information [571].  Baron d’Escornaix 1378.  m [https
2 CONC ://www.geni.com/people/Elisabeth-van-Gistel/6000000185361653909 ELISABETH van Gistel], '''daughter of ROGER van Gistel Heer van Straete & his wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Elisabeth-van-Dudzeele/6000000185361824916 Elisabeth [
2 CONC Margareta] van Dudzeele] (-after 1398).'''  Goethals records her parentage and marriage without citing any source which confirms the information[572].  A charter dated 1398 names “vrauwe Ysabel van Ghistele, twijf mins heere van S
2 CONC chorsche” as holder of “Ter Quinten” in Sint-Walburga parish, held from Veurne[573].  Arnaud & his wife had children: https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
