2 CONT ROBERT [II] de Wavrin (-[1273]). .. m secondly ([Dec 1244/1245]) as her second husband, MATHILDE de Béthune, widow of JEAN [II] Châtelain de Lille et de Péronne, daughter of GUILLAUME de Béthune Seigneur de Pont-Rohard & his wife 
2 CONC Elisabeth Dame de Pont-Rohard (-29 Dec after 1267).  
2 CONT >vi)        JEANNE de Wavrin (after 1244-).  The late 13th century genealogy by Balduinus de Avennis records that "Hellins [de Waurin]...li ainsnés des filz...Robert” married secondly, after the death of his first wife, “la fille 
2 CONC monseignour Guill de Bethune qui avoit esté femme le chastelain de Lisle” and had “i fil...Robers et pluseurs filles”, of whom one daughter married “monsr Rason de Gaure”[1162].  m RASO [XI] van Gavre, son of [RASO [IX] de Gavre &
2 CONC  his wife ---]. 
2 CONT * https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/nfranord.htm#IsabelleWavrinMErardBeveren
2 CONT
2 CONT RASO [IX] van Gavre ([1207/14]-).    m ---.  The name of Raso’s wife is not known.  
2 CONT >a)         RASO [XI] van Gavre ).  Heer van Gavre, Seigneur de Chièvres.  m JEANNE de Wavrin, daughter of ROBERT [II] de Wavrin & his second wife Mathilde de Béthune (after 1244-).  The late 13th century genealogy by Balduinus de
2 CONC  Avennis records that "Hellins [de Waurin]...li ainsnés des filz...Robert” married secondly, after the death of his first wife, “la fille monseignour Guill de Bethune qui avoit esté femme le chastelain de Lisle” and had “i fil...R
2 CONC obers et pluseurs filles”, of whom one daughter married “monsr Rason de Gaure”[558].  Raso [XI] & his wife had two children: 
2 CONT >>i)          RASO [XIII] van Gavre (-[26 Apr 1300/27 May 1301]).  Heer van Gavre, Seigneur de Chièvres. m (before Feb 1273) BEATRIX van Strijen, daughter of --- (-after 1282)
2 CONT >>ii)         ISABELLE van Gavre (-after 1289).  m GILBERT [III] van Zotteghem, son of --- (-after 1276).  
2 CONT * https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.htm#RasoGavreMJeanneWavrin
