1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT === Simon de Wissocq
2 CONT * Seigneur de Wissocq, Master of the Waters & Forest of West Flanders1
2 CONT * Last Edited	11 Mar 2012
2 CONT * M, #150916, b. circa 1302, d. 1359
2 CONT * Father	Guillaume de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq, Bailiff of Bailleul1 b. c 1262, d. 1309
2 CONT * Mother	Jacqueline de Ste. Aldegonde1 b. Dec 1279, d. 1324
2 CONT
2 CONT Simon de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq, Master of the Waters & Forest of West Flanders was born circa 1302 at of St. Omer, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.1 He married Jeanne de Haveskerke, daughter of Pierre de Haveskerk
2 CONC e, Seigneur de Renescure, d'Isberque, & de Wisquette and Marie de Straeten, circa 1328.1 Simon de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq, Master of the Waters & Forest of West Flanders died in 1359.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne de Haveskerke b. c 1307, d. 1364
2 CONT
2 CONT Child	
2 CONT #Nicolas de Wissocq, Sire de Wissocq, Burgess of St. Omer+1 b. c 1329, d. 1410
2 CONT
2 CONT
