1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/nfranord.htm#AnneWavrinMJeanMalet
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.    '''     [ANNE''' [Jeanne] '''de Wavrin''' .  Duchesne names Catherine as daughter of “Jean Malet II...seigneur de Gueraville, Sées et Bernay...[et sa] femme Anne de S. Venant fille de Robert Seigneur de Sainct-Venant” as wif
2 CONC e of “Jean Malet II...seigneur de Gueraville, Sées et Bernay”[1243].  Père Anselme names her “Anne alias Jeanne de Wavrin fille de Robert de Wavrin seigneur de S. Venant”, noting that her husband through her received payments from
2 CONC  the treasury in Mar 1315, which were due from “la forêt de Fontaines au pays de Caux” in 1317[1244].  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' JEAN [II] Malet Seigneur de Graville, son of [JEAN [I] Malet Seigneur de Graville & his wife --- (-after 1328).] 
2 CONT
2 CONT
