2 CONT Marie de Landas1,2,3 F, #148722, b. circa 1292, d. 1336 Father	Pierre de Landas, Grand Provost of Valenciennes, Seigneur de Warlaing, Bourcharde, & Sainghin-en-Mélantois1 b. c 1255, d. c 1308 Mother	Mahaut de Fiennes1 b. c 1272
2 CONT      Marie de Landas was born circa 1292 at of Mortagne-au-Perche, Orne, Lower Normandy, France.1 She married Sir Jean I de Mortagne, Seigneur de Landas, Bouvignies, Nomain, Roupy, Coutiches, & Flines, Governor of Bethune, Baron o
2 CONC f Flanders, son of Sir Baudouin II de Mortagne, Seigneur de Mortagne, Chatelain de Tournai and Béatrix de Landas, in 1312.1,2,3 Marie de Landas died in 1336.1 Family 	Sir Jean I de Mortagne, Seigneur de Landas, Bouvignies, Nomain,
2 CONC  Roupy, Coutiches, & Flines, Governor of Bethune, Baron of Flanders d. 1346 Children	
2 CONT
2 CONT     Marie de Mortagne+1 d. a 1352
2 CONT     Sir Jean II de Mortagne, Seigneur de Landas, Bouvignies, & Sainghin-en-Mélentois2,3 b. c 1315, d. 18 Sep 1356
