2 CONC ni.com/people/Jacqueline-de-Ch%C3%A2tillon-Dame-de-Cramoisy/6000000185361231884 Jacqueline de Châtillon Dame de Cramoisy].  m secondly (15 Sep 1420) [https://www.geni.com/people/Victor-de-Flandre-Seigneur-d-Ursele-et-de-Wesseghem/
2 CONC 6000000185362455848 VICTOR de Flandre Seigneur d’Ursele et de Wesseghem], illegitimate son of [https://www.geni.com/people/Louis-II-Count-of-Flanders/6000000185363088822 LOUIS II “de Mâle” Count of Flanders] & his [https://www.gen
