2 CONT *'''Family    Arnould VI de Gavre, Barron de Escornaix,   b. Abt 1366, of, Schorisse, Oost Vlaanderen, Belgium ,   d. 1 May 1418, Schorisse, Oost Vlaanderen, Belgium  
