2 CONT '''Isabeau Canart''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT WARNING: There is a data conflict!
2 CONT
2 CONT was born in 1260. Her parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-22542440 Collard Cannaert] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-22542443 Jehanne Le Prévost de Basserode]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Isabeau married [https://www.geni.com/profile-22542438 Jacquemon Denis] in 1310 in Lille, 59350, Nord, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France, . Together they had the following children:
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-22542437 Phane Denis] (*1286 - );
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-22542983 Bliot ou Bler Denis];
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/profile-92830904 Sainte (Sophie) dite de Fiennes Denis]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died. 
2 CONT ''(Biography generated on 02 Jun 2024)''
2 CONT ----
