2 CONT
2 CONT iii)       ''' [CATHERINE Malet''' (-22 Feb 1331, bur Sainte-Marie de Beaulieu).  The primary source which records her parentage and marriage has not been identified.  Duchesne names Catherine as daughter of “Jean Malet II...seign
2 CONC eur de Gueraville, Sées et Bernay...[et sa] femme Anne de S. Venant fille de Robert Seigneur de Sainct-Venant”[1016].  Alternatively, the chronology seems compatible with Catherine being the daughter of Jean [I] Malet.  Dupplesis 
2 CONC records the burial at Sainte-Marie de Beaulieu of “Catherine Mallet”, wife of Jean de Préaux, who died 22 Feb 1331[1017].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' JEAN de Préaux, son of --- (-[11 Jun] [1330], bur Sainte-Marie de Beaulieu).] 
