2 CONC 16 Mar 1503 in Portugal[580].  m JEAN de Luxembourg Heer van Zotteghem, son of THIBAUT de Luxembourg Seigneur de Fiennes & his wife Philippotte de Melun (-Portugal 17 Apr 1485). https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.
2 CONC htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>ii)        [https://www.geni.com/people/Johanna-de-Gavre-d-Escournaix/6000000014113456671?through=6000000185362767827 JEANNE de Gavre] (-29 May 1478, bur Deize).  Dame d’Escornaix, de Bracle et de Salardinghe.  Brassart record
2 CONC s her parentage and marriage without citing the sources on which the information is based[581].  An epitaph at Deinze, near Gent records the burial of “Simon de Lalaing chevalier seigneur de Montigny et de Santes fondateur de cett
2 CONC e église et Jeanne d’Escornaix dame de Bracle et Salardinghe sa femme”, providing brief biographical details, who died 15 Mar 1476 and 29 May 1478 respectively[582].  m ([1436]) SIMON de Lalaing Seigneur de Montigny, son of OSTE d
2 CONC e Lalaing & his wife Yolande de Barbançon Dame de Hantes (-15 Mar 1477, bur Deinze). https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
