2 CONC e and marriage without citing the sources on which the information is based[581].  An epitaph at Deinze, near Gent records the burial of “Simon de Lalaing chevalier seigneur de Montigny et de Santes fondateur de cette église et Je
2 CONC anne d’Escornaix dame de Bracle et Salardinghe sa femme”, providing brief biographical details, who died 15 Mar 1476 and 29 May 1478 respectively[582].  '''m ([1436]) [https://www.geni.com/people/Simon-X-de-Lalaing-seigneur-de-Mon
