1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''1375 Oorkonde in het bezit van de heer van Moezeke'''
2 CONT Dutch: Wy Lodewyck, graeve van Vlaenderen, hertoge van Brabant, graeve van Nevers, van Rethel ende heere van Machline, doen te weten allen lieden, dat op den dagh van heden vrouwe Marie, vrouwe van Maldeghem ende van Moerseke, ons
2 CONC  manschaep gedaen van eenen leene gehouden van ons descenderende van onsen casteele ende huuse van Bevere, geheeten de thiende van der Dorent, die haer toequam ende verstart van den heere van Moerseke, haren vader. also zoo seyt, 
2 CONC ter welcker manschepen wy haer ontfaen hebben behoudende onsen rechte, ende elk anders, ende hebben haer bevo­ len dat zoe by XL daegen eerst commende overgeve in geschrifte den castellain van Beveren de groote van den voorschreve
2 CONC n leene, met alsulcken dienst ende rechte alser toebehooren. Gegeven te Gendt, den 15 dagh van october, in 't jaer 1375.
2 CONT
2 CONT *descenderende: afhangende; verstart: als erfdeel toekwam.
2 CONT
2 CONT English: We Lodewyck, count of Flanders, duke of Brabant, count of Nevers, of Rethel and lord of Machline, give notice to everyone, that on this day Lady Marie, lady of Maldeghem and of Moerseke, gave us a lien held by us descendi
2 CONC ng from our caste and house of Bevere, called the tithe of the Dorent, which belonged to her and was granted to her by the lord of Moerseke, her father. And so it says, to whose manships we have granted her retention of our right,
2 CONC  and everything else, and have ordered her to surrender in writing to the castellan of Beveren the greatness of the aforementioned feud, with such service and rights as belong to it, by the first coming XL days. Given in Gendt, th
2 CONC e 15th day of October, in the year 1375.
2 CONT
2 CONT *descending: dependent; verstart: as inheritance due.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Martens, Marc, translator. “MALDEGHEM DIE LOYALE.” De Heemkundige Kring Het Ambacht Maldegem, Jaarboek 6, 26 Dec. 2000, p. 278''
2 CONT and
2 CONT ''De Lalaing, Marie Henriette Octavie Ghislaine van Maldeghem, La Loyale: Memoires Et Archives Publiés Par Mme La De Lalaing née Comtesse De Maldeghem. Ve Wouters, 1849, p. 413''
2 CONT ___________
2 CONT '''1376 Familiearchief'''
2 CONT Dutch: Wy Jan van Grimbergen, heere van Assche, doen cont, etc.. dat de edele vrouwe, Marie van Grimberge, vrauwe van Moerseke, onse lieve nichte, met myn heer Philips, heere van Maldeghem. haeren man, verzocht heeft Willem van Ou
2 CONC tzeverle allen de lee­ nen gelegen tot Libbeke, ende daer ontrent, metten heerschape, etc. Hier waeren over onse mannen van leen onsen lieven broeder Robrecht van Assche, riddere, Jan Vaenken. jaer 1376, op de 28 september.
2 CONT
2 CONT English: We John of Grimbergen, lord of Assche, do cont, etc.. that the noble lady, Marie of Grimberge, widow of Moerseke, our dear niece, with my lord Philips, lord of Maldeghem. her husband, has requested William of Outzeverle a
2 CONC ll the lands situated in Libbeke, and around there, with the lordship, etc. Here our men of fief waited on our dear brother Robrecht van Assche, knight, Jan Vaenken. yes 1376, on the 28th of September.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Martens, Marc, translator. “MALDEGHEM DIE LOYALE.” De Heemkundige Kring Het Ambacht Maldegem, Jaarboek 6, 26 Dec. 2000, p. 278''
2 CONT and
2 CONT ''De Lalaing, Marie Henriette Octavie Ghislaine van Maldeghem, La Loyale: Memoires Et Archives Publiés Par Mme La De Lalaing née Comtesse De Maldeghem. Ve Wouters, 1849, p. 413-414''
