1 NOTE Daughter and co-heir of Sir Payn Roet. Mistress of John of Gaunt by whom she bore children in adultery surnamed Beaufort. The issue were legitimated by statute (20 Rec II in 1397) but thereby were not enabled to inherit the Crown.
