1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Heini Landos of Pfaffikon, Canton Schwyz and of the villiage Menzinger, fled the Pfaffikon leaving 24 July 1424 from east of Lake Zurich to Zug. He moved from Canton Zug into the Hirzel region of Horgen by 1467.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is undoubtedly a son of Hansen Landos, settler of Menzinger on the 8th January 1393. He may also be a brother of Rudolph Landis who was in the Uerikon by 1415..
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hein Landos of Pfaffikon, Canton Schwyz and of the villiage Menzinger, fled the Pfaffikon leaving 24 July 1424 from east of Lake Zurich to Zug. He moved from Canton Zug into the Hirzel region of Horgen by 1467. He is undoubtedly a
2 CONC  son of Hansen Landos, settler of Menzinger on the 8th January 1393. He may also be a brother of Rudolph Landis who was in the Uerikon by 1415..
