2 CONC de Dieudonné, de Faye” who died 11 Sep 1476 and “Sibille de Ligne, dame d’Escornaix, de Romagies et de Fayel” who died 26 Jul “1418” [error][578].  Arnaud & his wife had one child: https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILI
2 CONC TY.htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
