2 CONT >>>>>(1)      ''' [https://www.geni.com/people/Jacqueline-van-Gavere/6000000015121507807?through=6000000015121625585 JACQUELINE de Gavre] (-Portugal 16 Mar 1503, bur Escornaix).  Goethals records her parentage and marriage without
