1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maria van Loon (c.1328 - 1400)
2 CONT
2 CONT (not to be confused with Maria van Loon (c.1281 - 1325), daughter of Arnold V van Loon (c.1258 - 1328) and Marguerite van Vianden (c.1258 - 1318))
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria *1328 's parents could not have been Arnold V van Loon  and Marguerite van Vianden, who died already in 1318.
2 CONT
2 CONT I. According to (1) https://gw.geneanet.org/jmpiresechehaye?lang=en&pz=jean+marie&nz=pire+sechehaye&p=louis+iv&n=de+looz+agimont
2 CONT
2 CONT and (2) https://gw.geneanet.org/pierfit?lang=en&p=louis&n=de+looz&oc=1
2 CONT
2 CONT and (3) -------------------------------- Medlands
2 CONT
2 CONT her father was: Lodewijk V Janszn. c.1300 van Loon-Agimont
2 CONT
2 CONT II. According to: http://racineshistoire.free.fr/LGN/PDF/La-Marck.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT her father was: Guillaume de Neufchateau (-en-Ardennes), husband of ? de Limbourg, dame de Lumain https://www.geni.com/people/Willem-van-Heinsberg-Neufchâteau/6000000086669643845
2 CONT
2 CONT For the moment, source I. is retained.
2 CONT
2 CONT Other sources about the Loon family: https://www.genealogieonline.nl/en/stamboom-baris/I7715.php
2 CONT
2 CONT from Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Jump to navigation Jump to search Arnold V von Loon Earl of Loon and Earl of Chiny Arnold looz Chiny.jpg Personal data Born	 1260 г. He died	 Avgust 22 1328 g. ('68) Agimont , Belgium Family F
2 CONC ather	Johann I Mother	Matilda of Jülich Marriage	Margaret of Vianden Descendants	Ludwig IV , Matilda, Johanna, Margaret, Mary Coat of arms	Loon-Chiny Arms.svg Arnold V von Loon (in Dutch : Arnold V van Loon ; in French : Arnoul V 
2 CONC de Looz ; * ok. 1260 ; † 22 august 1328 in Agimont , Belgium ) is a count of Loon from 1279 to 1323 and Earl of Chiny ( Arnold II ) from 1299 to 1310.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the son of Earl Johan I (Jean I, † 1279), Earl of Loon, and his first wife Matilda by Julius († 1279), the daughter of Count Wilhelm IV of Julich (1207-1218) and Matilda of Limburg + 1234). It is half-brother of Johann II (J
2 CONC ean II) von Loon and Chiny (1270-1311).
2 CONT
2 CONT Arnold is associated with Count Guy de Dampierre of Flanders . He participated in the Battle of Woeringen in 1288
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname  Arnold V married on July 27, 1280, to Margaret of Vianden (1253-8 March 1318), the daughter of Count Philippe I of Vianden, and has two children: [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludwig IV († 22 April 1336), followed his father in 1327 as Count of Loon and Chiny Matilda (1282-1313), in 1299, married to Count Gottfried I von Heinsberg and Blankenberg († 1331) Johanna, married to William of Oreye, lord of Ru
2 CONC mmen Margareta, married to William of Neufchâteau Maria (* circa 1275), ca. 1298 married to Count Eberhard I von Mark (ca.1249 - 1308)
