1 NAME Jacques de Lalaing “Le Bon Chevalier”
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE AFT 1421
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ecaussinnes
3 STAE Wallonia
3 POST 7191
3 CTRY Belgium
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 JUL 1453
