3 CONC tus cadet branch or a specific alliance with the House of Brittany or the Counts of Richmond.
3 CONT
3 CONT Since her nephew, Jan II van Stavele, is often called "Jan van Bretagne," this ermine field makes perfect sense. It visually connects her to the Comtal administration and the high nobility of the coast.
