1 NOTE {geni:about_me} knight, lord of Torcy, Ondeauville and Blainville, captain of Caen and Fécamps (1436, 1439), ambassador (1445), grand master of the crossbowmen of France (1446-1461 and 1465), counselor & chambellan of the King, kn
2 CONC ight of the Order of Saint-Michel, provost of Paris (1446-1447), lieutenant of the King in Champagne (1463-1465), captain de Chassenay, royal negotiator in Flanders, ? in Formigny (1450), ? in Guinegatte (1479)
