1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Adrienne de Berlaymont1 
2 CONT *''''''F, d. 29 April 1493
2 CONT *Father     Jacques de Berlaymont1
2 CONT *Mother     Catherine de Robersart1
2 CONT *''''''     Adrienne de Berlaymont married Sir Baudouin 'the Stammerer' de Lannoy, Seigneur de Molembais, Solre le Chateau, & Launay, Governor of Mortagne, son of Sir Guillebert I de Lannoy, Seigneur de Beaumont, Lesparre, & Lattr
2 CONC e and Catherine de Molembais, after 31 May 1433. Adrienne de Berlaymont died on 29 April 1493.1
2 CONT *''''''Family      Sir Baudouin 'the Stammerer' de Lannoy, Seigneur de Molembais, Solre le Chateau, & Launay, Governor of Mortagne b. c 1388, d. 1474
2 CONT *Children
