2 CONT
2 CONT Jean (Franchimont) III (or IV) de Lannoy
2 CONT ° ~1438 (bapt. 1456 according to Le Carpentier) + 1498
2 CONT Lord of Senzeilles, Maingoval, Rieulay,
2 CONT Yvoir and Audregnies (1465), Chamberlain of the Duke of Burgundy, Provost-le-Count of Valenciennes (1467, 91, 94)
2 CONT
