2 CONT ° ~1438 (Arms of Neuville (-en-Ferrain): "Or, three stripes gules")
2 CONT
2 CONT ep. 2) ~1480 Philippotte de Lalaing, lady of Rieulay (daughter of Simon, lord of Santes)
2 CONT
