2 CONT
2 CONT Jean was born in 1370 in Beauvoir, Picardy, France.  Jean's father was Guy de Luxembourg and his mother was Maud de Chatillon.  His paternal grandparents were Duke Jean de Luxembourg and Alix de Dampierre-Flandre, dame de Richebou
