2 CONT From thePeerage.com:
2 CONT
2 CONT      Mary Ferrers was born circa 1379.  She was the daughter of Sir Robert de Ferrers, 3rd Lord Ferrers (of Wem) and Lady Joan de Beaufort. She married Ralph de Neville, son of Ralph de Neville, 1st Earl of Westmorland and Lady Ma
2 CONC rgaret de Stafford, circa 1413 in a Oversley, Warwickshire, England marriage. She died on 25 January 1458.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Ferrers and Ralph de Neville
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Mary Neville b. c 1414
2 CONT
2 CONT     * John Neville+ b. c 1416, d. 17 Mar 1482
2 CONT
