2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 211-212.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. III, p. 249.
2 CONT *[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 15-16.
