2 CONT *'''Catherine NEVILLE (D. Norfolk)
2 CONT *'''Born: ABT 1401, Raby, Durham, England
2 CONT *'''Died: AFT Jan 1478/ABT 1483
2 CONT *'''Notes: famed for having made the "Diabolical Marriage" to the young John Woodville''' to advance the family of his sister Elizabeth. '''John was 20 at his marriage; Catherine 80. Catherine Neville was last heard of at the coro
2 CONC nation of her nephew Richard III in 1483.
2 CONT *Father: Ralph NEVILLE (1° E. Westmoreland)
2 CONT *Mother: Joan BEAUFORT (C. Westmoreland)
