2 CONC e, Radulphum de Neuille militem, Margaretam uxorem Ricardi Lescrope de Bolton" as the children of "Radulphus dominus de Neuill et comes Westmorlandie" and "Margareta filia Hugonis comitis Stafford, uxor prima"[848].  m (before 139
2 CONC 9) THOMAS de Dacre Lord Dacre of Gilsland, son of WILLIAM de Dacre Lord Dacre & his wife [Joan Douglas] (Naworth Castle 27 Oct 1387-5 Jan 1458, bur Lancercost Priory). 
2 CONT **    4.         JOHN ([1387]-1420).  A mid-15th century manuscript names "Matillidem dominam de Maulay, Alesiam uxorem Thome Gray, Philippam dominam de Dacre, Johannem, Elizabetham minorissam, Annam uxorem Gilberti Vmfraville, Ra
2 CONC dulphum de Neuille militem, Margaretam uxorem Ricardi Lescrope de Bolton" as the children of "Radulphus dominus de Neuill et comes Westmorlandie" and "Margareta filia Hugonis comitis Stafford, uxor prima"[849].  Lord Neville.  m (
2 CONC 1394) ELIZABETH de Holand, daughter of THOMAS de Holand Earl of Kent & his wife Alice FitzAlan of Arundel (-1423).  John & his wife had three children: 
