2 CONC um de Neuille militem, Margaretam uxorem Ricardi Lescrope de Bolton" as the children of "Radulphus dominus de Neuill et comes Westmorlandie" and "Margareta filia Hugonis comitis Stafford, uxor prima"[853].  m (before 3 Feb 1413) G
2 CONC ILBERT Umfraville of Harbottle, son of THOMAS Umfraville of Harbottle & his wife Agnes --- (Harbottle Castle 18 Oct 1390-killed in battle Baugé, Anjou 22 Mar 1421). 
2 CONT **    7.         RALPH (-1458).  A mid-15th century manuscript names "Matillidem dominam de Maulay, Alesiam uxorem Thome Gray, Philippam dominam de Dacre, Johannem, Elizabetham minorissam, Annam uxorem Gilberti Vmfraville, Radulph
2 CONC um de Neuille militem, Margaretam uxorem Ricardi Lescrope de Bolton" as the children of "Radulphus dominus de Neuill et comes Westmorlandie" and "Margareta filia Hugonis comitis Stafford, uxor prima"[854].  m MARY Ferrers, daughte
