2 CONT *Ralph NEVILLE (1° E. Westmoreland)
2 CONT *Born: 1363, Raby, Durham, England
2 CONT *Died: 21 Oct 1425, Raby Castle, Durham, England
2 CONT *Buried: Collegiate Church, Staindrop, Durham, England
2 CONT *Notes: Knight of the Garter. The Complete Peerage, v.XIIpII,pp544-549-supported his brother-in-law *Henry IV's seizure of power 1399.
2 CONT *Father: John NEVILLE (3° B. Raby)
2 CONT *Mother: Maud PERCY (B. Raby)
2 CONT *Married 1: Margaret STAFFORD (C. Westmoreland) ABT 1382, Stafford, Staffordshire, England
2 CONT *Children: 
2 CONT **1. Maud NEVILLE (B. Mauley) (b. ABT 1383 - d. Oct 1438)
2 CONT **2. Alice NEVILLE
2 CONT **3. Anne NEVILLE
2 CONT **4. Phillippa NEVILLE (B. Dacre of Gillesland)
2 CONT **5. John NEVILLE (Sir)
2 CONT **6. Elizabeth NEVILLE (b. ABT 1389)
2 CONT **7. Ralph NEVILLE (Sir Knight)
2 CONT **8. Margaret NEVILLE (B. Scrope of Bolton)
2 CONT **9. Anastasia NEVILLE (b. ABT 1395)
