2 CONT *'''     Sir George Nevill, 1st Lord Latimer was born circa 1414 at of Raby, Durham, England. He married Elizabeth Beauchamp''', daughter of Sir Richard Beauchamp, 13th Earl Warwick, Earl of Albemarle & Worcester, Lord Abergavenny
2 CONC , Sheriff of Worcestershire and Elizabeth Berkeley, '''circa 13 February 1437; They had 2 sons''' (Sir Henry; & Thomas) '''and 1 daughter''' (Katherine, wife of Oliver Dudley, & of Sir James Radcliffe).13,3,4,5,14,6,7,8,9 '''Sir G
2 CONC eorge Nevill, 1st Lord Latimer Became a lunatic, but with lucid intervals. before 11 June 1451.14,8 He died on 30 December 1469; Buried at Well, Yorkshire.3,14,8
