2 CONT *'''George Neville, 1st Lord Latymer1
2 CONT *'''M, #107410, d. 30 December 1469
2 CONT *Last Edited=15 Sep 2013
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.03%
2 CONT *'''     George Neville, 1st Lord Latymer was the son''' of Ralph de Neville, 1st Earl of Westmorland and Lady Joan de Beaufort.1 '''He married Lady Elizabeth Beauchamp''', daughter of Richard Beauchamp, 13th Earl of Warwick and E
2 CONC lizabeth de Berkeley, '''circa February 1436/37.2 He died on 30 December 1469.3
2 CONT *'''     He was invested as a Knight in 1426.2 He was created 1st Lord Latymer [England] on 25 February 1431/32.2 In 1436 Scottish Wars.4 He held the office of Justice of the Peace (J.P.) for Cumberland in 1437.2 He was invested a
2 CONC s a Privy Counsellor (P.C.) in 1439.2 On 11 June 1451 he became a lunatic but had lucid intervals, and went on to be called to Parliamen tfor another 18 years.4 
2 CONT *'''     Succeeded to the Latymer estates on the death of his uncle and was summoned to Parliament as a Baron from 25 Feb 1431/2.
2 CONT *'''Children of George Neville, 1st Lord Latymer and Lady Elizabeth Beauchamp
2 CONT **Sir Henry Neville+4 d. 26 Jul 1469
