2 CONT *'''     Sir Edward Neville, 1st Lord Abergavenny was the son''' of Ralph de Neville, 1st Earl of Westmorland and Lady Joan de Beaufort.2 '''He married, firstly, Elizabeth Beauchamp, Lady Bergavenny''', daughter of Richard Beaucha
2 CONC mp, 1st Earl of Worcester and Isabel le Despenser, '''before 18 October 1424.1 He married, secondly, Katherine Howard''', daughter of Sir Robert Howard and Lady Margaret de Mowbray, '''on 15 October 1448, by special dispensation.3
2 CONC  He died on 18 October 1476.3
2 CONT *'''      He cohabited with his second wife, Katherine, during the lifetime of his first, Elizabeth.3 He was created 1st Lord Abergavenny [England by writ] on 5 September 1450, also known as Lord Bergavenny.3,4
2 CONT *'''Children of Sir Edward Neville, 1st Lord Abergavenny and Elizabeth Beauchamp, Lady Bergavenny
