2 CONT *Notes: '''he inherited her first wife family title. He cohabited with his second wife, Catherine, during the lifetime of his first, Elizabeth. He was created 1st Lord Abergavenny on 5 Sep 1450.
2 CONT *Father: Ralph NEVILLE (1° E. Westmoreland)
2 CONT *Mother: Joan BEAUFORT (C. Westmoreland)
2 CONT *'''Married 1: Elizabeth BEAUCHAMP (b. 1415 - d. 18 Jun 1447) (descendant of Edward III) BEF 18 Oct 1424
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Alice NEVILLE
