1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *''''''Sir Baudouin 'the Stammerer' de Lannoy, Seigneur de Molembais, Solre le Chateau, & Launay, Governor of Mortagne1 
2 CONT *''''''M, b. circa 1388, d. 1474
2 CONT *Father     Sir Guillebert I de Lannoy, Seigneur de Beaumont, Lesparre, & Lattre d. 1406
2 CONT *Mother     Catherine de Molembais d. 1433
2 CONT *''''''     Sir Baudouin 'the Stammerer' de Lannoy, Seigneur de Molembais, Solre le Chateau, & Launay, Governor of Mortagne was born circa 1388.1 He married Adrienne de Berlaymont, daughter of Jacques de Berlaymont and Catherine d
2 CONC e Robersart, after 31 May 1433. Sir Baudouin 'the Stammerer' de Lannoy, Seigneur de Molembais, Solre le Chateau, & Launay, Governor of Mortagne died in 1474.1
2 CONT *''''''Family      Adrienne de Berlaymont d. 29 Apr 1493
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **◦Philippine de Lannoy+2 b. c 1437, d. 10 Nov 1500
