1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://translate.googleusercontent.com/translate_c?depth=1&hl=en&prev=search&rurl=translate.google.ca&sl=fr&sp=nmt4&u=https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jean_Ier_de_La_Marck&usg=ALkJrhjSeyqLmyTMAeWoQiqZW2I9AnrhEQ
