1 NAME Regnier /Desprest dit de Quiévrain/
2 GIVN Regnier
2 _MARNM Desprest dit de Quiévrain
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1500
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Parentage speculative.
2 CONT
2 CONT Identical coat of arms as the 'Desprest dit de Kiévrain' family. There was a member of the family called Thierry Desprest who became Echevin of Valenciennes. Considering this Desprest family in Valenciennes with the same coat of a
2 CONC rms a hundred years later was marrying into families who also had Echevins of Valenciennes, I think it is extremely likely these Desprests are descended from Thierry Desprest.
