2 CONT __________
2 CONT '''Anne de Lalaing''', born around 1503, died in 1569, married to Nicolas DE LANNOY, knight, lord of Maingoval; she inherited from her brother Pontus, and her daughter brought into the family of Sainte-Aldegonde the lordships of B
2 CONC ugnicourt, Hordaing and other lands of the elder branch of Lalaing.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Brassart, Felix, Société Académique, editor. Souvenirs De La Flandre Wallonne, Catalogue des Nobels de Nom, de Lalaing, Dix-Septieme, L. Crépin, 1882. un Comite Historique et Archeologique: Memories of Walloon Flanders: pp. 51-5
