3 CONT Why do I want  the profile to remain on the list until I've checked it too? Because some of the least suited to medieval modifications have attached to my ankles: They take you literally, like a child trying to make fun of you. Yo
3 CONC u're too good to punish them; I suffer from too many persecution crazes to ignore their childish actions :D  
2 NOTE Thanks for the attractive image, Livio, and the work finding profiles it’s tagged to.
3 CONT
