2 CONC r-Yon and Margaret de Chambley, '''on 9 November 1454 at Angers, Marne-et-Loire, Pays de la Loire, France.6 Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendome died on 6 January 1478 at Chateau de Lavardin, Vendome, France'''.
