2 CONT '''Jean VIII de Bourbon-Vendome'''
2 CONT '''BIRTH	1425'''
2 CONT '''DEATH	6 Jan 1478 (aged 52–53)'''
2 CONT '''BURIAL	Church of Saint-Georges'''
2 CONT '''Vendome, Departement du Loir-et-Cher, Centre, France'''
2 CONT Find a Grave Memorial ID: 86648180
2 CONT '''Nobility, only surviving child''' of Louis I and Jeanne de Laval. '''Succeeded his father in 1446 as count of Vendôme'''.
2 CONT Family Members
