2 CONT *Father  James I Stewart King of Scotland,   b. Dec 1394, Dunfermline Palace, Fife, Scotland ,   d. 21 Feb 1436-1437, Murdered In Monastry Of The Friars Preachers, Perth  (Age ~ 42 years) 
2 CONT *Mother  Joan (of Somerset) Beaufort,   b. Abt 1406,   d. 15 Jul 1445, Dunbar Castle  (Age ~ 39 years) 
2 CONT *Family 1  James (3rd Earl of Angus) Douglas,   d. 1446 
2 CONT *Married  18 Oct 1440 
2 CONT *'''Family 2  James (1st Earl of Morton) Douglas,   d. 1493 
2 CONT *'''Married  Bef 15 May 1459 
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **	1. John (2nd Earl of Morton) Douglas,   b. Bef 1466,   d. 1513  (Age ~ 47 years)
2 CONT **	2. Janet (of Morton) Douglas,   d. Yes, date unknown
