1 NOTE Earl of Lennox
1 NOTE 1ST EARL OF ATHOL
1 NOTE He succeeded his father in 1439. He was created a Lord of Parliament with the title of Lord Derneley, probably at the coronation of King James III on 3 Aug 1460. He inherited his great grandfather, Duncan, Earl of Lennox's title o
2 CONC n 23 Jul 1473 and assumed the title of Earl of Lennox.
