1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Anne Beaufort was a descendant of several noble lines. The website http://www.thepeerage.com/p10273.htm#i102730 has full details of these lines, which go back to John of Gaunt and Katherine de Swynford (nee Roet). 
2 CONC John of Gaunt was the son of Edward III of England.
