2 CONT      John Neville was born circa 1416 at Oversley, Warwickshire, England G.2 He was the son of Ralph de Neville and Mary Ferrers.1 He married Elizabeth Newmarch, daughter of Robert Newmarch, circa 1442 in a Oversley, Warwickshire,
2 CONC  England marriage.2 He died on 17 March 1482.3
2 CONT
2 CONT      He held the office of Sheriff of Lincolnshire from 1439 to 1440.3
