2 CONT ** 14. THOMAS GRAY, Knt., of Wark. Heaton (in Norham), etc. Northumberland. Captain of Norham Castle, son and heir, born about 1456 (aged 8 in 1464). He married MARGERY GREYSTOKE, daughter of Ralph Greystoke, Knt. 5th Lord Greysto
