1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Joan Greystoke1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9
2 CONT *'''F, #16373, d. after 1472
2 CONT *Father      Sir John Greystoke, 4th Baron Greystoke, Governor of Roxburgh Castle2,3,5,6,8,9 b. c 1390, d. 8 Aug 1436
2 CONT *Mother     Elizabeth Ferrers2,3,5,6,8,9 b. c 1393, d. 1434
2 CONT *'''     Joan Greystoke married John Darcy, 7th Baron Darcy of Nocton, son of Sir John Darcy, 5th Baron Darcy, 4th Lord Meinell and Margaret Grey, circa 1423; They had 5 sons (Sir Richard; Phillip; John; Thomas; & George) and 3 da
2 CONC ughters (Elizabeth; Joan, wife of John Beaumont, Esq; & Eleanor).2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9 Joan Greystoke died after 1472; She married (2) Sir William Stoke.3,6,9
