2 CONT *'''Married: Ralph EURE
2 CONT *'''Children: 
2 CONT **1. Joan EURE (b. ABT 1438 - d. Unmarried) 
2 CONT **2. William EURE (Sir)
2 CONT **3. Ralph EURE (b. ABT 1442 - d. BEF 19 Jun 1484)
2 CONT **4. Elizabeth EURE
2 CONT **5. Henry EURE (b. ABT 1446)
2 CONT **6. John EURE (b. ABT 1446 - d. Child)
2 CONT **7. Margery EURE (b. ABT 1448) 
2 CONT **8. Robert EURE (b. ABT 1450)
2 CONT **9. John EURE (b. ABT 1452 - d. BEF 11 Jun 1483)
