2 CONT ==Henry Percy, 2nd Earl of Northumberland==
2 CONT '''M, #10447, b. 25 July 1421, d. 29 March 1461'''
2 CONT Last Edited=29 Jan 2013
2 CONT '''Henry Percy''', 2nd '''Earl of Northumberland was born on 25 July 1421 at Leconfield, Yorkshire, England.1 He was the son''' of Henry de Percy, 1st Earl of Northumberland and Lady Eleanor de Neville. '''He married Eleanor de Po
2 CONC ynings, Baroness de Poynings''', daughter of Sir Richard de Poynings and Joan Seamer, '''before 25 June 1435.2 He died on 29 March 1461 at age 39 at Towtown, Yorkshire, England, killed in action.'''
2 CONT '''He gained the title of 2nd Earl of Northumberland in 1455. He fought in the Battle of Towton on 29 March 1461'''.3
2 CONT '''Children of Henry Percy, 2nd Earl of Northumberland and Eleanor de Poynings, Baroness de Poynings'''
