2 CONT *Mother: Eleanor NEVILLE (C. Northumberland)
2 CONT *'''Married: Edmund GREY (1° E. Kent) BEF Jan 1458/9
2 CONT *Children:
2 CONT **1. Anthony GREY (4° B. Grey of Ruthin)
2 CONT **2. Elizabeth GREY
2 CONT **3. Anne GREY
2 CONT **4. George GREY (2° E. Kent)
2 CONT **5. John GREY
2 CONT **6. Edmund GREY (b. ABT 1457, Ruthin, Denbighshire, Wales)
2 CONT *From: http://www.tudorplace.com.ar/PERCY.htm#Catherine PERCY (C. Kent)
