2 CONC "[1902].  m (after 10 May 1457) as his first wife, THOMAS Stanley Earl of Derby, son of THOMAS Stanley Lord Stanley & his wife Joan Goushill of Hoveringham, Nottinghamshire ([1435]-Lathom 29 Jul 1504, bur Burscough Priory, Lancash
