2 CONT ***          Geoffrey de Neville (Burreth) d.ca.1193 = Emma de Bulmer ; ch: Henry (d.1226), Isabel (m. Robert fitz Melred) de Neville
2 CONT ****               Isabel de Neville = Robert fitz Melred ; ch: Geoffrey de Neville Raby d.ca.1242 ; ch: Robert (m. Ida ), Geoffred (m. Margaret de Lungvillers), John de Neville
2 CONT *****                    Geoffrey de Neville c.1285 = Margaret de Lungvillers ; ch: John (1332), Geoffrey, Robert, Edmund (1315-44), William Neville
