2 CONT *'''Katherine Neville1
2 CONT *'''F, #3313, d. before 22 November 1503
2 CONT *Last Edited=18 Jan 2011
2 CONT *Consanguinity Index=0.42%
2 CONT *'''     Katherine Neville was the daughter''' of Richard de Neville, 5th Earl of Salisbury and Alice Montagu, Countess of Salisbury.1 '''She married, firstly, William Bonville, 6th Lord Harington''', son of William Bonville and E
2 CONC lizabeth Harington, '''circa 1458.1 She married, secondly, Sir William Hastinges, 1st Lord Hastings''', son of Sir Leonard Hastinges and Alice de Camoys, '''before 6 February 1461/62.1 She died before 22 November 1503.1
2 CONT *'''      Her married name became Bonville. From before 6 February 1461/62, her married name became Hastings.1
2 CONT *'''Child of Katherine Neville and William Bonville, 6th Lord Harington
2 CONT **Cecilia Bonville, Baroness Bonville and Harington+ b. c 1461, d. 12 May 1529
2 CONT *'''Children of Katherine Neville and Sir William Hastinges, 1st Lord Hastings
2 CONT **Anne Hastings+2
2 CONT **Richard Hastings2 b. 1464, d. 1465
2 CONT **William Hastings2 b. 1466, d. 1466
2 CONT **Sir Edward Hastings, 2nd Lord Hastings+2 b. c 1467, d. bt 4 Nov 1506 - 15 Nov 1506
2 CONT **Richard Hastings+3 b. 1468
2 CONT **Sir William Hastings+3 b. 1470, d. a 1541
