2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Neville was the daughter of''' Richard de Neville, 5th Earl of Salisbury and Alice Montagu, Countess of Salisbury.1 '''She married John de Vere, 13th Earl of Oxford''', son of John de Vere, 12th Earl of Oxford and
2 CONC  Elizabeth Howard.1 '''She died after 20 November 1506'''.1
2 CONT ''' After her marriage, Lady Margaret Neville was styled as Countess of Oxford.'''
