2 CONT *''''''     Margaret Neville was born after 1448. She was the daughter of Sir Edward Neville, 1st Lord Abergavenny and Katherine Howard.1 She married John Brooke, 7th Lord Cobham (of Kent), son of Edward Brooke, 6th Lord Cobham (o
2 CONC f Kent) and Elizabeth Tuchet, before 1481.1 She died on 30 September 1506.1 She was buried at Cobham, Kent, England.2
2 CONT *''''''     From before 1481, her married name became Brooke.1
2 CONT *Child of Margaret Neville and John Brooke, 7th Lord Cobham (of Kent)
2 CONT **1.Thomas Brooke, 8th Lord Cobham (of Kent)+2 d. 19 Jul 1529
2 CONT *Citations
