2 CONT      Catherine Stafford was the daughter of Humphrey Stafford, 1st Duke of Buckingham and Lady Anne Neville. She married John Talbot, 3rd Earl of Shrewsbury, son of John Talbot, 2nd Earl of Shrewsbury and Elizabeth Butler, circa 1
2 CONC 467. She died on 26 December 1476.
