2 CONT *'''Anne Plantagenet Saint Leger
2 CONT *'''Birth: 	Aug. 10, 1439  Fotheringhay, Northamptonshire, England
2 CONT *'''Death: 	Jan. 12, 1475  Windsor, Berkshire, England
2 CONT *'''English Aristocracy. Born the second child, though first surviving''', of Richard Plantagenet, 3rd Duke of York and Lady Cecily Neville, '''at Fotheringhay Castle. Her younger brothers''' included Edward IV and Richard III of 
2 CONC England. '''She married Henry de Holland, 2nd Duke of Exeter, about 1447, and with him had one daughter. They divorced in November of 1472, and she then married Thomas St. Leger, Controller of the Mint. She died due to complicatio
2 CONC ns from the birth of their only daughter'''. (bio by: Iola) 
2 CONT *Family links: 
