3 CONT    Henry III King of England  • 1207-1272
3 CONT    Edward I “Longshanks” King of England • 1239-1307
3 CONT    Edward II King of England • 1284  - 1327
3 CONT    Edward III King of England • 1312 -1377
3 CONT    Philippa de Hainault (Counts of Holland), Queen consort of England, 
3 CONT    married to Edward III, King of England • 1312 – 1369
3 CONT     John of Gaunt 1st Duke of Lancaster • 1340 – 1399
