2 CONT F, #70166, '''b. circa 1412, d. before 1 November 1437'''
2 CONT Father	Sir Edward Stradling, Sheriff of Dorsetshire & Somersetshire, Constable of Taunton1,6,7,8,9 b. c 1389, d. c 27 Jun 1452
2 CONT Mother	Joan Beaufort1,6,7,8,9 b. c Jan 1392, d. 19 Oct 1479
2 CONT '''     Katherine (Joan) Stradling was born circa 1412 at of St. Donat's, Glamorganshire, Wales. She married Maurice Dennis, Esq., Sheriff of Gloucestershire''', son of Sir Gilbert Dennis, Sheriff of Gloucestershire and Margaret R
2 CONC ussell, '''circa 1433; They had 2 sons''' (Sir Walter; & John). His 1st marriage.1,2,3,4,5 '''Katherine (Joan) Stradling died before 1 November 1437'''.1,4
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Maurice Dennis, Esq., Sheriff of Gloucestershire''' b. c 1410, d. a 1466
2 CONT '''Child'''	
2 CONT Sir Walter Dennis, Escheator & Sheriff of Gloucestershire+1,4 b. c 1434, d. 1 Sep 1505
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT [S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 57.
2 CONT [S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 117.
