2 CONT [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 433-434.
2 CONT [S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. V, p. 55.
2 CONT [S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. IV, p. 116-117.
