1 CONT
1 CONT Heini Landos of Pfaffikon, Canton Schwyz and of the villiage Menzinger, fled
1 CONT the Pfaffikon lleaving 24 July 1424 from east of Lake Zurich to Zug. He moved
1 CONT from Canton Zug into the Hirzel region of Horgen by 1467.
1 CONT He is undoubtedly a son of Hansen Landos, settler of Menzinger on the
1 CONT 8th January 1393. He may also be a brother of Rudolph Landis who was in the
1 CONT Uerikon by 1415.
