1 CONT Edward IV (28 April 1442 – 9 April 1483) was King of England from 4 March 1461 until 2 October 1470, and again from 11 April 1471 until his death.
1 CONT Contents
1 CONT [hide]
1 CONT
1 CONT     * 1 Reign
1 CONT           o 1.1 Accession to the Throne
