1 CONT see notes of feud on Anne B Neville
1 CONT received titles of Earl of Warwick, and Salisbury because of his wife
1 CONT 1479 E iv prevented Clarence marrying Mary of Burgundy, followed by a Scottish princess
1 CONT imprisoned by E iv and tried before parliament
1 CONT Feb 1478 Duke of Buckingham replaced Gloucester as Seneschal of England and then pronounced sentence of death on Clarence
1 CONT His mother interceded and requested that the sentence should be carried out in private and not the standard hang, draw and quartering - instead let him choose his death. It is believed he was drowned in a vat of malmsey following 
1 CONC a jest made to the king
